{"id":"303c0ec892c0532c","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-well-order.md","title":"ZFC Well Order","display":"df-zfc-well-order — ZFC Well Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-well-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-well-order","58-df-zfc-order6-well-order","58-df-zfc-poset-well-order"],"display":"df-zfc-well-order — ZFC Well Order","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-linear-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-well-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-well-order</span><span>58-df-zfc-order6-well-order</span><span>58-df-zfc-poset-well-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-well-order — ZFC Well Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-linear-order\">58-df-zfc-linear-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> (carrier variable in the one-sorted ZFC domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_W\\subseteq W\\times W\">\\(\\leq_W\\subseteq W\\times W\\)</span> (order relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\\)</span> (linear-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-linear-order\">58-df-zfc-linear-order</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}well\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(W,\\leq_W) \\leftrightarrow \\leq_W\\subseteq W\\times W\\land \\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(W,\\leq_W)\\land \\forall A\\subseteq W\\;(A\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;(a\\leq_W b))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}well\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(W,\\leq_W) \\leftrightarrow \\leq_W\\subseteq W\\times W\\land \\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(W,\\leq_W)\\land \\forall A\\subseteq W\\;(A\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;(a\\leq_W b))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-order6-well-order</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-poset-well-order</code> are aliases of this well-order predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S$ (linear-order predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-linear-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_W\\subseteq W\\times W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}well\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(W,\\leq_W) \\leftrightarrow \\leq_W\\subseteq W\\times W\\land \\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(W,\\leq_W)\\land \\forall A\\subseteq W\\;(A\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;(a\\leq_W b))","display":true}],"bytes":1017,"backlinks":[{"id":"7e3dced24b5c71e9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0356d8ecaaf34dec","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S$ (well-order predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-well-order.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3865","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-well-order.md|58-df-zfc-well-order]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b40aa6d4a7d8288a"]}